        ],
        "verified": true,
        "wiringNote": "Wired, but thin: `collect_crashed()` runs at process start (xai-grok-pager-bin/src/main.rs:1973) and only logs the count. The returned Vec<ActiveSession> has no consumer beyond that log line."
