          "An overflow check and the number shown to the user must use the same predicate, which is why the threshold helpers live here rather than at each call site."
        ],
        "failurePolicy": "fail-soft - the estimate is a heuristic that under- or over-counts; the fail-safe direction is supplied by the headroom variant rather than by the estimator, which has no error path at all (the functions are total).",
