      {
        "name": "validate-then-freeze-tool-registry",
        "what": "A toolset is not usable until a validation pass succeeds and the registry is frozen. `validate_config(&ToolServerConfig)` returns `Vec<RequirementError>` and checks, in order: the behavior preset exists, the tool id is registered, the behavior version resolves, params deserialize into the typed params struct, client-facing names are unique, and the standard (`read_file`/`search_replace`/`grep`) and hashline file-tool bundles are not mixed (xai-grok-tools/src/registry/types.rs:795-938). `finalize_with_trunc_config` re-runs that validation and returns `Err(errors)` before building the immutable finalized toolset (registry/types.rs:963-973). Out-of-tree tool packs invert the dependency via `register_tool_pack` with a documented ordering contract - registration must happen before the first `ToolRegistryBuilder::new()` (registry/types.rs:27-51).",
        "invariants": [
          "Finalization is validate-then-freeze: there is no path that produces a mutable toolset, and any validation error prevents a toolset from existing at all.",
          "A config `kind` that deserializes to `ToolKind::Other` must warn, because a silent `Other` demotes the tool in the restrictive subagent capability modes.",
          "Tool packs must register before the first builder construction; the ordering is a contract, not an implementation detail.",
          "Validation short-circuits after each stage so errors are reported one class at a time - a caller fixing one class reveals the next."
        ],
        "failurePolicy": "fail-closed - any RequirementError makes finalize return Err and no toolset is produced.",
        "constants": [
          {
            "name": "error categories",
            "value": "\"behavior_preset\", \"tool_not_found\", \"behavior_version\", \"duplicate_client_name\", \"file_toolset_conflict\"",
            "evidence": "crates/codegen/xai-grok-tools/src/registry/types.rs:808-911"
          },
          {
            "name": "standard file bundle",
            "value": "GrokBuild:read_file | search_replace | grep; hashline bundle GrokBuildHashline:hashline_read | hashline_edit | hashline_grep",
            "evidence": "crates/codegen/xai-grok-tools/src/registry/types.rs:883-892"
          }
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "crates/codegen/xai-grok-tools/src/registry/types.rs:27-51",
          "crates/codegen/xai-grok-tools/src/registry/types.rs:795-938",
