      {
        "name": "declarative-tool-requirement-and-params-validation",
        "what": "Two declarative layers guard every tool config rather than ad-hoc checks. `Expr<T>` is a generic boolean tree - `Value`, `And`, `Or`, `Not`, `True`, `False` - evaluated by a caller-supplied closure, with `ToolRequirement` variants `Tool`, `ToolKind`, `IfParams` and `InputParam` (xai-grok-tools/src/types/requirements.rs:17-59, :110-198). The whole tree is evaluated in one loop against the resolved toolset (registry/types.rs:928-936). `InputParam` is the sharp one: it verifies the referenced parameter is actually visible in the dependent tool's JSON schema, which is needed because description templates interpolate `${{ params.<kind>.<param> }}` and a reference to a non-existent param would render as text rather than fail (requirements.rs:134-139, :187-195). Parameter validation separately deserializes through `serde_path_to_error` to obtain the failing field path, classifies the serde message into a stable category, then runs the type's own `validate_params_value` for semantic checks (xai-grok-tools/src/types/params_validation.rs:44-73, categories at :119-131).",
        "invariants": [
          "Requirements are evaluated against the proposed configuration including params, not against static metadata - `ToolKind { if_params }` requires at least one tool of that kind whose params actually satisfy the expression.",
          "`IfParams` is vacuously true when its condition is false, so an inapplicable requirement cannot accidentally block.",
          "A params type must implement `ResourceType` to be validatable; effective params are merged only after validation passes."
        ],
        "failurePolicy": "fail-closed - an unsatisfied requirement yields an `unsatisfied requirements` error and blocks finalization.",
        "constants": [
          {
            "name": "params error categories",
            "value": "params_unknown_field, params_missing_field, params_unknown_variant, params_type, params_invalid",
            "evidence": "crates/codegen/xai-grok-tools/src/types/params_validation.rs:120-130"
          }
        ],
